{"id":222562,"name":"T26C-0-2, 1BDR","headline":"The Snuggy 1BDR @ Tawila El Gouna","summary":"","description":{"Space":"\n\r\nThis lagoon front 1 bedroom apartment with a sofa bed is located in Gouna's beloved Tawila community and overlooking the lagoon. \r\n\r\nIt features an open plan fully equipped kitchen, one bedroom and a living room. \r\n\r\nIt also features a 50 inch smart TV with Airplay and cable channels, washing machine, a Nespresso machine, kettle and a microwave. \r\n\r\nThe styling of the villa is tailored to give the guests a relaxing and a unique vibe.\r\n\r\n\r\nAt Xuru Stays, we’re committed to providing our guests the magical hospitality they deserve.\r\n\r\n","Access":"\r\n\r\nGuests have access to the entire property\r\n\r\n","Interaction":"\r\n\r\nWe are more than happy to answer all of your questions. Guests can text and call anytime they need help and our team will be there in about 30 mins to solve any issue immediately.\r\n\r\nAt Xuru Stays, we’re committed to providing our guests the magical hospitality they deserve.\r\n\r\n","Neighborhood":"\r\n\r\n-Tawila is uniquely located 400 meters from Gourmet (grocery store). Guests will be able to walk 5 minutes and get to it. \r\n- Abu Tig Marina is a 4 minute drive from Tawila (features many restaurants, cafes and bars)  \r\n\r\n","Transit":"\r\n\r\nFree outdoor parking is available. \r\nTuktuks are available to take you anywhere in El Gouna (flat fee).\r\n\r\n","Notes":"\r\n\r\nPlease note that smoking is not allowed inside the apartment. A fine of $100 may be imposed in case of smoking indoors."},"city":"El Gouna","capacity_of_guests":3,"number_of_bedrooms":1,"number_of_beds":2,"number_of_bathrooms":2,"number_of_stars":4,"location_address1":"El Gouna, Hurghada 2, Red Sea Governorate 1982710","location_address2":"","location_lat":"27.402484","location_lng":"33.6511438","booking_link":null,"airbnb_link":null,"rental_type":"apartment","featured":false,"cleaning_fee":20,"checkin_time":15,"checko