a lovely view of the lagoon and walking distance to the swimming pool. Our unit matched the description and was packed with all necessary amenities. Xuru stays were always helpful, swift in their response to ensure we enjoyed our stay. \n\nI look forward to coming again soon!","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z"},{"id":5337782,"review":"All was great","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:29.000000Z"},{"id":5406889,"review":"Very nice clean and quiet good location view","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:40.000000Z"},{"id":5417471,"review":"Thanks for having us it was a great time","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z"},{"id":5426536,"review":"Nice cozy apartment","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z"},{"id":5486056,"review":"I always book with Xuri Stays. their properties math photos and description, and their support is unmatched. Thank you Xuri Stays you never disappoint","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z"},{"id":5590167,"review":"Great host!","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z"},{"id":5626248,"review":"The place is good but a bit far from downtown, so you’ll need to use Uber for all your trips. The place needs a deep cleaning—there’s accumulated dust and dirt at the entrance and inside the house, along with small spiders and ants.\nAlso, the curtain is ugly, poorly fitted, and not clean","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z"},{"id":5633508,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z"},{"id":5633599,"review":"Great unit","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z"},{"id":5669607,"review":"The unit was one of the best homes that I stayed in in Gouna ever!\n\nI always and will always choose one of Xuru Stays listings because of their perfect customer service.","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z"},{"id":5718180,"review":"First of all the place is so dark and terrifying because of no lighting outside the terrace , second found a lot of hair on the sofa and the sofa is not comfy at all , it needs maintenance also , the floor was full of big ants , the pool was not clean the whole days I didn’t even enjoy it ! finally i lost my hand watch there !","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z"},{"id":5729647,"review":"I have been to ElGouna many times before, however this is the best place/host I stayed at, everything was perfect.\n\nHighly recommended","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z"},{"id":5741682,"review":"The place was amazing - cozy and clean. All amenities were in good shape. Direct access to the lagoon & close to the pool. Very good location of the property within Tawila\n\nOnly issue i faced was with the AC in the bedroom, it didn’t cool. When i requested support, xuru stays team were fast to send a technician, however, he was unable to help - played around with the modes on the AC remote and seemed like he didn’t know what he was doing.\n\nOther than that property is 10/10, highly recommend for a getaway","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z"},{"id":5749004,"review":"Nice stay. Good communication and friendly hosts.","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z"},{"id":5768790,"review":"Before my stay I made sure to let them know how I expected the place to be since my wife is pregnant, but getting there, unfortunately, the place wasn’t clean, very dusty, smelly fridge and spider webs in the bathroom. Also, the bed is extremely low quality so it makes really loud noise whenever you sleep on it which is very inconvenient. The team was responsive and sent someone to clean again but they couldn’t fix the bed. The cleanness wasn’t also the best after they sent someone, so they partially refunded us. Overall the place is good since we like Tawila but the apartment isn’t comfortable. \n\nOne last thing I’m annoyed with is them keeping to ask me for a 5 star review after all this. Which basically is asking me to lie about my experience in exchange of them giving me 5 stars too. If they maintain the place it could be great but so fat it’s not.","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:31.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:31.000000Z"},{"id":5769730,"review":"Slow response from call center","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:31.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:31.000000Z"},{"id":5787349,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z"},{"id":5793225,"review":"Good value for money, the place looks exactly as described with a shared pool and swimmable lagoon. \n\nHost is responsive and cleared out any issues we faced! \n\nJust a recommendation maybe some deep cleaning for the sofa would make it better, but overall good experience and will definitely book again!","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z"},{"id":5860908,"review":"i really enjoyed using this company to book my stay in gouna.  the team was very helpful, friendly and professional and the location and condition of the apartment were as explained and convenient for a short stay","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z"},{"id":5861668,"review":"I spent two nights at a cozy 1-bedroom, and had a great stay. The place was clean, comfortable, and perfectly located in a quiet area with lovely lagoon views. The outdoor area was a highlight for morning coffee. Just note there’s no dishwasher, but everything else was well-equipped. The host was responsive and check-in was very smooth. Overall, highly recommended and I’d stay again.","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z"},{"id":5865687,"review":"Positive:\nالمكان هادي و نظيف جدا\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:53.000000Z"},{"id":5884529,"review":"Positive:\nDie Lage\n\nNegative:\nDas Bett war wirklich ungemütlich und die Couch im Wohnzimmer sehr durchgesessen.","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z"},{"id":5890361,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z"},{"id":5916789,"review":"Amazing experience","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z"},{"id":5931119,"review":"Perfect getaway, great hosts😊","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z"},{"id":5954980,"review":"It was okay but I think there’s room for improvement. ","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:13.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:13.000000Z"},{"id":6003873,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z"},{"id":6104113,"review":"My stay with XURU Stays — honest feedback from a loyal guest\n\nXURU’s team deserves genuine praise — responsive, kind, and proactive throughout. They offered alternative accommodation, a 20% compensation, outdoor furniture to replace a broken swing, a fruit platter, and daily check-ins. Truly professional handling.\n\nThat said, the unit itself was a letdown. The sofa was broken and uncomfortable, the garden swing unusable, and the mattress worn and noisy — not the standard I’ve come to expect from XURU. Given it was peak season with no alternatives available, I had no choice but to stay.\n\nI still trust XURU and believe this was an isolated oversight in pre-stay furniture checks rather than a reflection of their usual quality. I hope this review helps them maintain the high standards they’re known for.","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z"},{"id":6161462,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":222562,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}